<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>A cooker costs Ksh <m>{31\,000}</m> cash. Its hire purchase price is Ksh <m>{36\,400}</m>: a deposit of Ksh <m>{5200}</m> and then <m>{12}</m> equal monthly instalments.</p><p>(a) Find the total of the instalments.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans1"/>  </p><p>(b) Find each instalment.</p><p>Ksh <fillin characters="10" name="ans2"/>  </p></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>(a) The instalments pay the hire purchase price after the deposit: <m>{36\,400} - {5200} = {31\,200}</m>.</p><p>(b) Each instalment is <m>{31\,200} \div {12} = {2600}</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>31200</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>2600</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>